# oħra / ieħor / oħrajn, "another", which trails the unit in every CLDR
# future-offset pattern ("fi żmien jumejn oħra", "sa ġimgħa oħra").  The
# masculine ieħor goes with a masculine unit noun (xahar), the feminine oħra
# with the rest.  Unicode CLDR 47, mt dateFields.json,
# relativeTime-type-future.
oħra
ieħor
oħrajn
